26T16:52","compound":"Hydrogen Iodide","pounds":1277.27,"facility_id":null,"distance_km":null,"bearing_deg":null,"in_corridor":null,"resolution":"unresolved: facility not located"}],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 05/26/2025 in Harris County (1 found; search complete)."},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0803","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[93.0,111.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On May 26, 2025, the Texas state monitor at HRM-3 Haden Road recorded 14.28 ppb of benzene in the 8:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.18 ppb. Wind there came from 111 degrees at 5.1 mph. 41 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. No matching report was found in the records checked; the search is incomplete. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 26 de mayo de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-3 Haden Road registró 14.28 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 8:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.18 ppb. El viento venía de 111 grados a 5.1 mph. Hay 41 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' would not mean 'illegal': Texas requires a report only above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approxima